    id: "slovenia-logatec-cities-v2", "sights": {"de": [{"name": "Betonska plaža", "text": "Dieser betonierte Badeplatz bietet ein ausgesprochen urbanes Schwimmerlebnis direkt in Logatec. Die Stimmung ist hier praktisch und gemeinschaftsorientiert, was das funktionale Design der Anlage widerspiegelt. Badegäste können sich auf den glatten Flächen sonnen und anschließend zur schnellen Abkühlung direkt ins erfrischende Wasser springen. Ein dickes Handtuch oder eine gepolsterte Liegematte erhöhen den Komfort auf dem harten Untergrund spürbar.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [14.206781, 45.910181]}, {"name": "Gozdni rezervat Petkova grapa", "text": "Ein ruhiges Naturschutzgebiet in Logatec, bekannt für seine geschützte Waldlandschaft.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.194363, 45.921614]}, {"name": "Gradišnica", "text": "Der Eingang zur Gradišnica-Höhle bei Logatec, eine bedeutende Karsterscheinung.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.236083, 45.894817]}, {"name": "Drevored Napoleonove lipe", "text": "Eine historische Lindenallee in Logatec, die lokal mit der napoleonischen Zeit in Verbindung gebracht wird.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.230522, 45.925532]}, {"name": "Lokomotiva JŽ 17-086", "text": "Eine erhaltene Dampflokomotive, die als technisches Denkmal in Logatec ausgestellt ist.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.235395, 45.917446]}], "hu": [{"name": "Betonska plaža", "text": "Ez a betonozott fürdőhely kifejezetten városi úszásélményt kínál Logatec szívében. A hangulat rendkívül praktikus és közösségközpontú, ami hűen tükrözi a terület letisztult kialakítását. A látogatók a sima, lapos felületeken napozhatnak, majd a gyors hűsölés érdekében közvetlenül a frissítő vízbe ugorhatnak. Egy vastagabb törölköző vagy egy párnázott matrac mindenképpen kényelmesebbé teszi a parton való heverészést.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [14.206781, 45.910181]}, {"name": "Gozdni rezervat Petkova grapa", "text": "Logatec mellett fekvő természetvédelmi terület, amely védett erdőiről ismert.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.194363, 45.921614]}, {"name": "Gradišnica", "text": "A Logatec közelében található Gradišnica-barlang bejárata, jellegzetes karsztképződmény.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.236083, 45.894817]}, {"name": "Drevored Napoleonove lipe", "text": "Történelmi hárssor Logatecben, amelyet a helyi hagyomány Napóleon korához köt.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.230522, 45.925532]}, {"name": "Lokomotiva JŽ 17-086", "text": "Logatecben kiállított gőzmozdony, amely technikai műemlékként látható.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.235395, 45.917446]}], "ro": [{"name": "Betonska plaža", "text": "Acest loc de scăldat din beton oferă o experiență de înot distinct urbană chiar în inima orașului Logatec. Atmosfera este extrem de practică și orientată către comunitate, reflectând clar designul simplu al zonei. Vizitatorii pot face plajă pe suprafețele plane și netede înainte de a sări direct în apa răcoroasă pentru o împrospătare rapidă. Un prosop gros sau o saltea ușor căptușită vă va îmbunătăți cu siguranță confortul în timp ce vă relaxați aici.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [14.206781, 45.910181]}, {"name": "Gozdni rezervat Petkova grapa", "text": "O rezervație naturală liniștită în Logatec, cunoscută pentru mediul forestier protejat.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.194363, 45.921614]}, {"name": "Gradišnica", "text": "Intrarea în peștera Gradišnica de lângă Logatec, o formațiune carstică notabilă.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.236083, 45.894817]}, {"name": "Drevored Napoleonove lipe", "text": "O alee istorică de tei în Logatec, asociată local cu epoca napoleoniană.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.230522, 45.925532]}, {"name": "Lokomotiva JŽ 17-086", "text": "O locomotivă cu abur conservată, expusă ca monument tehnic în Logatec.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.235395, 45.917446]}], "en": [{"name": "Betonska plaža", "text": "This concrete bathing spot provides a distinctly urban swimming experience right in the heart of Logatec. The atmosphere is highly practical and community-focused, clearly reflecting the straightforward design of the area. Visitors can sunbathe on the flat, smooth surfaces before hopping directly into the refreshing water for a quick cool-down. A thick towel or a slightly padded mat will definitely improve your comfort while lounging here.", "category": "recreational", "coords": [14.206781, 45.910181]}, {"name": "Gozdni rezervat Petkova grapa", "text": "A peaceful nature reserve in Logatec, known for its protected forest environment.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.194363, 45.921614]}, {"name": "Gradišnica", "text": "The entrance to the Gradišnica cave near Logatec, a notable karst feature.", "category": "natural", "coords": [14.236083, 45.894817]}, {"name": "Drevored Napoleonove lipe", "text": "A historic avenue of linden trees in Logatec, locally associated with the Napoleonic era.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.230522, 45.925532]}, {"name": "Lokomotiva JŽ 17-086", "text": "A preserved steam locomotive displayed as a technical monument in Logatec.", "category": "landmark", "coords": [14.235395, 45.917446]}]},
