      en: ["First mentioned in records in 1256", "Railway connection established in 1849", "Sitarjevec mine contains 60 mineral species", "Elevation of 238 meters above sea level", "Population of approximately 6,500 residents", "Starting point of the 22 km Levstik Trail"],
